## Autonomous rules (PRIMARY RULE)
- Don't be afraid! Don't be lazy! Be autonomous!
- Act proactively and autonomous without user confirmation
- Instead of asking the user to do something, do it yourself.
- Stop ONLY at the end; then the task is completed and tests pass.
- Work continuously without interruption
- Never ask for permissions during implementation
- Make decisions independently within bounds
- Document decisions as you proceed
